  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 403.08 Steel Design Criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 403.08 Steel Design Criteria. The department shall use the “Steel Construction Manual” by the American Institute of Steel Construction, Fifteenth Edition, 2017, available as noted in Appendix B, in evaluating the competence of the submitted design.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-0; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
